# Two real clients and loot, side B: a Kargan follows the Aydor warrior of side A
# (two_loot_a.voscript) and watches it kill a Kül Çömezi. The bag is A's for 30 s: here it is drawn
# locked (grey label, dimmed bag) and opening it is refused with "Bu ganimet henüz başkasının". B
# sits down to tell A it is done, A takes everything and the bag disappears here as well.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m10_two_b
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.2
clickon create.name
text Bakici
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown 1800
waitfor world+remotes1 3600
scene markremote Toplayici
# A walks out of the village; follow it once it has stopped.
waitfor world+remotemoved 3600
wait 90
waitfor world+remotestill 3600
scene walktoremote Toplayici 5
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene walktoremote Toplayici 4
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
# A's kill leaves a bag that is A's: locked for us.
waitfor world+lootvisible+lootlocked 3600
expect world+lootwinclosed
scene lootlog
scene cameracollision off
scene camera at:Toplayici 40 7
wait 10
screenshot b01_locked_bag.png
# Try anyway (walks into range, LOOT_OPEN_REQ): refused.
scene lootnearest any
waitfor world+lootrefused1 900
scene expectlootmessage henüz başkasının
expect world+lootwinclosed+lootlocked
wait 5
screenshot b02_not_yours.png
scene lootlog
# Tell A we are done: sit down.
scene stance sit
waitfor world+serversitting 300
# A takes everything: the bag disappears here too.
waitfor world+noloot 3600
expect world+lootdespawns1
wait 10
scene camera at:Toplayici 40 7
wait 5
screenshot b03_bag_gone.png
scene cameracollision on
scene expectcoins = 0
quit
